      "machineHash": "d685400c89b4763d91939f05432fee81874fb96029196473d414daea2ae7e616",
      "machineText": "登録が有効になるのは即時ではなく、*次回のログイン時*です。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Registration takes effect on the *next login*, not immediately.",
